OL,3,Vupppppp5CFriday
OL,5,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,6,     FBen journeys to rural Thailand to
OL,7,     Fmeet Yidan, who left city life to
OL,8,     Fbuild a farm from scratch. As he
OL,9,     Fhelps her work, he uncovers the
OL,10,     Freasons behind her transformation.
OL,11,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,12,     F...the Wild. The adventurer
OL,13,     Freturns, visiting former war
OL,14,     Fjournalist Ali to find out what
OL,15,     Ftook his host from reporting on
OL,16,     Fthe front line to life on a remote
OL,17,     Fisland on Lake Victoria.
