OL,10,G0205 Autopsy
OL,11,     FOn February 27th, 2015, Leonard
OL,12,     FNimoy, the actor best known as
OL,13,     FStar Trek's Mr Spock, died from
OL,14,     FCOPD at the age of 83. This
OL,15,     Fepisode examines his health in
OL,16,     Fthose final days. (Ep26)
